   6:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****   *          functionalities of the Universal Asynchronous Receiver Transmitter Peripheral (UART).
