  26:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****  ===============================================================================
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****   [..]
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     The UART HAL driver can be used as follows:
  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Declare a UART_HandleTypeDef handle structure (eg. UART_HandleTypeDef huart).
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccrZx1zi.s 			page 2


  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Initialize the UART low level resources by implementing the HAL_UART_MspInit() API:
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) Enable the USARTx interface clock.
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) UART pins configuration:
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the UART GPIOs.
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure these UART pins as alternate function pull-up.
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process (HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_IT() APIs):
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the USARTx interrupt priority.
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC USART IRQ handle.
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) UART interrupts handling:
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****               -@@-  The specific UART interrupts (Transmission complete interrupt,
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****                 RXNE interrupt, RX/TX FIFOs related interrupts and Error Interrupts)
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****                 are managed using the macros __HAL_UART_ENABLE_IT() and __HAL_UART_DISABLE_IT()
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****                 inside the transmit and receive processes.
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) DMA Configuration if you need to use DMA process (HAL_UART_Transmit_DMA()
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****              and HAL_UART_Receive_DMA() APIs):
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Declare a DMA handle structure for the Tx/Rx channel.
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock.
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the declared DMA handle structure with the required Tx/Rx parameters.
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the DMA Tx/Rx channel.
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Associate the initialized DMA handle to the UART DMA Tx/Rx handle.
  53:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Configure the priority and enable the NVIC for the transfer complete
  54:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****                   interrupt on the DMA Tx/Rx channel.
  55:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  56:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Program the Baud Rate, Word Length, Stop Bit, Parity, Prescaler value , Hardware
  57:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         flow control and Mode (Receiver/Transmitter) in the huart handle Init structure.
  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  59:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) If required, program UART advanced features (TX/RX pins swap, auto Baud rate detection,...)
  60:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         in the huart handle AdvancedInit structure.
  61:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  62:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the UART asynchronous mode, initialize the UART registers by calling
  63:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         the HAL_UART_Init() API.
  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the UART Half duplex mode, initialize the UART registers by calling
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         the HAL_HalfDuplex_Init() API.
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the UART LIN (Local Interconnection Network) mode, initialize the UART registers
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         by calling the HAL_LIN_Init() API.
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the UART Multiprocessor mode, initialize the UART registers
  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         by calling the HAL_MultiProcessor_Init() API.
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For the UART RS485 Driver Enabled mode, initialize the UART registers
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         by calling the HAL_RS485Ex_Init() API.
  76:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  77:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  78:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (@) These API's (HAL_UART_Init(), HAL_HalfDuplex_Init(), HAL_LIN_Init(), HAL_MultiProcessor_Ini
  79:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         also configure the low level Hardware GPIO, CLOCK, CORTEX...etc) by
  80:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         calling the customized HAL_UART_MspInit() API.
  81:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  82:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     ##### Callback registration #####
  83:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     ==================================
  84:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
  85:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  86:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
  87:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
  88:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccrZx1zi.s 			page 3


  89:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
  90:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Use Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
  91:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Function HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
  92:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
  93:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
  94:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
  95:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
  96:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
  97:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
  98:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
  99:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
 100:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) WakeupCallback            : Wakeup Callback.
 101:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
 102:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
 103:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
 104:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
 105:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 106:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
 107:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 108:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 109:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Use function HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 110:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     weak function.
 111:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     HAL_UART_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 112:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     and the Callback ID.
 113:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 114:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
 115:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 116:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 117:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 118:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 119:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 120:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortTransmitCpltCallback : Abort Transmit Complete Callback.
 121:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) AbortReceiveCpltCallback  : Abort Receive Complete Callback.
 122:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) WakeupCallback            : Wakeup Callback.
 123:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) RxFifoFullCallback        : Rx Fifo Full Callback.
 124:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) TxFifoEmptyCallback       : Tx Fifo Empty Callback.
 125:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : UART MspInit.
 126:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : UART MspDeInit.
 127:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 128:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 129:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     For specific callback RxEventCallback, use dedicated registration/reset functions:
 130:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     respectively HAL_UART_RegisterRxEventCallback() , HAL_UART_UnRegisterRxEventCallback().
 131:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 132:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 133:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     By default, after the HAL_UART_Init() and when the state is HAL_UART_STATE_RESET
 134:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 135:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     examples HAL_UART_TxCpltCallback(), HAL_UART_RxHalfCpltCallback().
 136:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are respectively
 137:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_UART_Init()
 138:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     and HAL_UART_DeInit() only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 139:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_UART_Init() and HAL_UART_DeInit()
 140:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand).
 141:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 142:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 143:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_UART_STATE_READY state only.
 144:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit that can be registered/unregistered
 145:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     in HAL_UART_STATE_READY or HAL_UART_STATE_RESET state, thus registered (user)
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccrZx1zi.s 			page 4


 146:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 147:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 148:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     using HAL_UART_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_UART_DeInit()
 149:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     or HAL_UART_Init() function.
 150:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
 151:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     [..]
 152:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     When The compilation define USE_HAL_UART_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 153:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     not defined, the callback registration feature is not available
 154:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****     and weak callbacks are used.
 155:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c **** 
